      "text": "Some notable RB splits from yesterday:\n\n1. NYJ - In Breece Hall's return from quad injury, he got 19 opportunities vs. Braelon Allen 10. Braelon did outsnap Breece 37-27.\n\n2. DEN - Jonah Coleman 58 snaps, JK Dobbins 11, other RBs 0. Over the last two weeks, Coleman 37 opportunities vs. Dobbins 12.\n\n3. SEA - Zach Charbonnet out-snapped Jadarian Price 37-24, and out-routed him 13-9. George Holani got just 2 snaps.\n\n4. LV - In a trailing script, Ashton Jeanty 32 snaps vs. Mike Washington 17. Jeanty 24-6 in routes, carries 6-6.",
